// CotSC localization Batch 23: QCHSTIM
@1 = ~This building... it doesn't look the same from the outside, or inside. It's... strange. Your memory is changing this place significantly. I wonder why?~
@2 = ~I have no clue. Perhaps a few memories get juggled up together.~
@3 = ~Who knows? Let's see what else this place has in store for us.~
@4 = ~At least it isn't a portal to Avernus, right? Ehm, sorry... I try to keep myself cheerful. Takes my mind off how awful the place I used to grow up in looks, you know.~
@5 = ~As terrible as it looks, anything is better than what Irenicus put us through.~
